## K Pro v1

**Purpose:** Predict pitcher strikeout totals and find edges on DK K props (O/U lines and ladder rungs).

**Model:** XGBoost Poisson regressor (`count:poisson`) predicts lambda (expected K count). Then Monte Carlo (N=10,000 simulations) converts lambda to a full probability distribution, and edges are calculated independently per O/U line and per ladder rung.

**Features:** Pitcher rolling K%, swinging strike rate, zone%, count-leverage stats (`balls`/`strikes` available 2021+), opponent K rate and top-3 batter K rate, umpire K boost, is_home, implied win probability, temp, dome flag. `bat_speed` explicitly excluded — 2024+ only, breaks walk-forward CV.

**Performance target:** MAE < 1.2 Ks, R² > 0.15, calibration within 5% of mean actual.

**DK scraper:** Two URLs — standard O/U (`strikeouts-o-u`) and ladder (`strikeouts` with `k_1plus` through `k_8plus`).

**Settlement:** Uses boxscore `strikeOuts` field, not Statcast pitch events.

