## Shared Assumptions Across All Systems

- Statcast master CSV is single source of truth — `statcast_master.csv` replaces all prior per-system files
- Walk-forward CV folds: train on prior years, test on next (2023/2024/2025 folds)
- All systems use Kelly with fractional sizing, capped at `max_kelly_pct`
- No live deployment until paper trading gate (200 bets) is cleared on each system
- Cloud deployment (GCP e2-small + GCS) deferred until gates clear
